{"_id":"68a7360d8ec3d8323af125f9","nodeId":"F8frGuv1dunOdcVJ_IiGs","roadmapSlug":"backend","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.149Z","description":"# NoSQL databases\n\nNoSQL databases handle unstructured, semi-structured, or rapidly changing data with flexible schemas. Four types: Document stores (MongoDB, CouchDB), Key-value stores (Redis, Riak), Column-family (Cassandra, HBase), and Graph databases (Neo4j, Neptune). Used for high scalability, flexibility, and performance applications.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Types of NoSQL Databases: How to Choose the Right One","url":"https://roadmap.sh/backend/types-of-nosql-databases","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4622"},{"type":"article","title":"NoSQL Explained","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/nosql-explained","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4623"},{"type":"video","title":"How do NoSQL Databases work","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0buKQHokLK8","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4624"},{"type":"video","title":"SQL vs NoSQL Explained","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ruz-vK8IesE","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4625"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T07:26:50.654Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04ddfb5fcb94d04169c0","title":"Scrimba - Backend Developer Career Path","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"http://scrimba.com/the-backend-developer-path-c0tbi0l98f?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/backend/content/F8frGuv1dunOdcVJ_IiGs.md"}
